  "main_html": "<section class=\"hero training-marker\" data-training-page=\"true\" style=\"background:#fff3cd;border:3px solid #d97706;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><p class=\"kicker\">TRAINING PAGE</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">Training page</h1><p><strong>Sandbox only.</strong> Not a production or sponsor-facing page.</p><p class=\"muted\">This page is copied from the real canonical pack and marked as training.</p></section>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Hormone Optimization Guides \u00b7 Independent educational publisher</p>\n  <h1>Hormone Optimization Guides</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Hormone Optimization Guides publishes educational frameworks for TRT, IV therapy, hair restoration, peptides, and adjacent optimization services.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section conversion-cta conversion-cta--primary\" data-primary-conversion-cta=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"conversion-cta__panel conversion-cta__panel--primary\">\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__eyebrow\">Start here</p>\n    <h2 class=\"conversion-cta__heading\">View your next steps</h2>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__body\">Use the dedicated next-steps path after you review the homepage short answer, provider preview, and state routing.</p>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__actions\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary conversion-cta__button\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/next-steps/?src=%2F&amp;intent=decision_hub&amp;button=next_steps_cta&amp;vertical=trt&amp;page_kind=global&amp;page_slug=home\" data-provider-type=\"Hormone / Wellness Clinic\" data-page-src=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\" data-button-source=\"next_steps_cta\" data-intent-type=\"decision_hub\" data-market-slug=\"\" data-page-kind=\"global\" data-vertical-key=\"trt\">View Your Next Steps</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"callout answer-block\" data-home-answer=\"true\" data-short-answer=\"true\">\n  <h2>Short answer</h2>\n  <p>Hormone Optimization Guides is a neutral resource that helps people understand testosterone therapy, IV hydration, hair restoration, and peptide-based treatments. Most useful when you need to compare clinic fit, treatment type, and monitoring expectations, Hormone Optimization Guides explains what to consider before starting. Hormone Optimization Guides does not recommend specific providers, but it does clarify what usually matters most before you move into a local page or next steps.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-about-block=\"true\">\n  <h2>About Hormone Optimization Guides</h2>\n  <p>Hormone Optimization Guides exists to explain how hormone, wellness, and restoration clinics differ, what to verify, and what questions matter most before you contact a provider.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section provider-directory-section provider-directory-section--preview\" data-provider-directory=\"true\" data-home-provider-preview=\"true\"><h2>Examples of providers</h2><p class=\"muted\">These are neutral, non-ranked examples of clinics and providers so the homepage feels concrete before you narrow into a state or city page.</p><div class=\"provider-directory-grid\"><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Gameday Men&#39;s Health</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Hormone optimization clinic \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Use this example when you want an in-person TRT clinic conversation in Atlanta.</li><li>Ask what startup labs, repeat labs, and follow-up visits are included before treatment starts.</li><li>May also offer peptide programs</li><li>Compare evaluation steps, monitoring, and follow-up clarity</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Hone Health</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Hormone optimization clinic \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Use this example when you are comparing remote-first convenience against local hands-on follow-up.</li><li>Ask how labs, dose changes, and symptom check-ins are handled if the first plan needs revision.</li><li>May also offer peptide programs</li><li>Compare evaluation steps, monitoring, and follow-up clarity</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Low T Center</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Hormone optimization clinic \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Use this example when you want to compare a dedicated low-testosterone clinic model against broader hormone-optimization branding.</li><li>Ask what happens in the first 90 days and what would make the clinic slow down instead of starting fast.</li><li>May also offer peptide programs</li><li>Compare evaluation steps, monitoring, and follow-up clarity</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Prime IV Hydration</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">IV hydration clinic \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>May also offer peptide programs</li><li>Compare IV protocols, pricing, and supervision</li><li>Ask what is included before treatment starts and what is billed separately</li></ul></article></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section faq-entry-card\" data-home-faq-entry=\"true\"><h2>Need quick answers first?</h2><p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ when you want definitions, costs, timing questions, and fast clarification before you open a state page.</p><p class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://local-gu